{
  "id": "2026-09-17-weather-based-discount",
  "name": "Weather-based discount",
  "description": "This design adds a 10 percent offer-level discount granted while it rains or snows in Warsaw ([Discount in bad weather](noesis:need|rain-discount)), and prepares the model for further weather-based discounts ([Further weather discounts](noesis:need|further-weather-discounts)).\n\n# Where it lands\n\n- The new [weather](noesis:module|discounts.weather) module holds the current weather, as a condition a discount can depend on.\n- The new [openmeteo](noesis:module|discounts.weather.openmeteo) module inside it holds the Open-Meteo service as the source of that weather.\n- The existing calculation module gains the new discounts and carries the weather to them.\n\n# Where to start reading\n\n1. [WeatherProvider](noesis:building_block|discounts.weather.WeatherProvider) is the port: [getCurrent](noesis:behavior|discounts.weather.WeatherProvider.getCurrent) gives a [Weather](noesis:building_block|discounts.weather.Weather) snapshot, precipitation in millimetres, or says the weather is unknown.\n2. [OpenMeteoWeatherProvider](noesis:building_block|discounts.weather.openmeteo.OpenMeteoWeatherProvider) implements it; any failure of the API means unknown weather, never an error in discount calculation ([Pricing without weather](noesis:need|pricing-without-weather)).\n3. [DiscountPolicyFactory.get](noesis:behavior|discounts.calculation.DiscountPolicyFactory.get) reads the weather once per policy resolution (spec, rule 4) and puts it into [Conditions](noesis:building_block|discounts.calculation.Conditions), which gains the optional weather.\n4. [PotentialPrecipitationDiscount.isApplicableFor](noesis:behavior|discounts.calculation.PotentialPrecipitationDiscount.isApplicableFor) holds exactly when the known precipitation is above 0 mm (spec, rule 1); unknown weather grants nothing (spec, rule 2). [Its discount](noesis:behavior|discounts.calculation.PotentialPrecipitationDiscount.getDiscount) is a [PercentageDiscount](noesis:building_block|discounts.calculation.PercentageDiscount) of 10 percent.\n\n# Around them\n\n- [PercentageDiscount.apply](noesis:behavior|discounts.calculation.PercentageDiscount.apply) records one offer-level discount amount; weather discounts stack with every other discount (spec, rule 3).\n- [DiscountPolicyFactory](noesis:building_block|discounts.calculation.DiscountPolicyFactory) gains the weather port. [DiscountsConfigProvider](noesis:building_block|discounts.calculation.DiscountsConfigProvider) registers the precipitation discount next to the VIP discount in [getDiscountsConfig](noesis:behavior|discounts.calculation.DiscountsConfigProvider.getDiscountsConfig).\n\n# Left for later\n\n- Further weather discounts: a field on `Weather`, a parameter in the adapter and a potential discount registered in the configuration (spec, Extension recipe).\n- Caching, retries and a configurable location (spec, Scope).",
